<div><strong>Time</strong></div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Hours / o'clock</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">點鐘</div>
        <div class="col">number + dím-jūng</div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">鐘頭</div>
        <div class="col">number + jūng-tàuℏ</div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">小時</div>
        <div class="col">number + síu-sìℏ</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>24 hours</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">廿四小時</div>
        <div class="col">number + yaℏ-sei síu-sìℏ</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Minutes</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">分鐘</div>
        <div class="col">number + fàn-jūng</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Five minutes (5 mins) period</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">個字</div>
        <div class="col">number + go-jiℏ</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Quarter of an hour</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">個嗗</div>
        <div class="col">number + go-gwāt</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Morning (a.m.)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">上晝</div>
        <div class="col">seuℏng-jau + time</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Afternoon (p.m.)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">下晝</div>
        <div class="col">haℏ-jau + time</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>What time is it?</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">幾多點鐘呀?</div>
    <div>géi-dō dím-jūng a?</div>
    <div><strong>Dates are expressed as</strong></div>
    <div>Year-Month-Day Weekday a.m./p.m. Hours-Minutes-Seconds</div>
    <div>year + <strong>nìℏn</strong> + month + <strong>yuℏt</strong> + day + <strong>houℏ</strong></div>
    <div>30th June 1997</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">一九九七年六月三十號</div>
    <div>yāt-gáu-gáu-chāt-nìℏn luℏk-yuℏt sàam-saℏp-houℏ</div>
    <div><strong>2 o'clock</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">两點鐘</div>
        <div class="col">léuℏng-dím-jūng</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Half past 2</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">两點半(鐘)</div>
        <div class="col">léuℏng-dím-bun(-jūng)</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>1:59 (precision time)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">一點五十九分鐘</div>
        <div class="col">yāt-dím ńgℏ-saℏp-gáu-fàn-jūng</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>1:25 (using 5 min periods)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">一點五個字</div>
        <div class="col">yāt-dím ńgℏ-go-jiℏ</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Quarter past 2</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">两點一個嗗</div>
        <div class="col">léuℏng-dím yāt-go-gwāt</div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">两點三個字</div>
        <div class="col">léuℏng-dím sàam-go-jiℏ</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Quarter to 2 or 1:45</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">一點三個嗗</div>
        <div class="col">yāt-dím sàam-go-gwāt</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>4:35 p.m. on Tuesday</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">星期二下晝四點七個字</div>
    <div>sìng-kèiℏ-yiℏ haℏ-jau sei-dím chāt-go-jiℏ</div>
</div>
<div><strong>Money</strong></div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Whole dollar values use (colloquial)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">蚊</div>
        <div class="col">mān</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Dollars and cents use</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">個...(銀錢)</div>
        <div class="col">go + number + (ngàℏn-chín)</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Fifty cents (50¢)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">個半</div>
        <div class="col">go-bun</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Ten cents (10¢)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">毫子</div>
        <div class="col">hòuℏ-jí</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Formal Dollar ($)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">(圓)元</div>
        <div class="col">yùℏn</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Hong Kong Dollar</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">港元/港紙</div>
        <div class="col">góng-yùℏn / góng-jí</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Chinese Renminbi (RMB)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">人民幣</div>
        <div class="col">yàℏn-màℏn-baiℏ</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>American Dollar</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">美元/美金</div>
        <div class="col">méiℏ-yùℏn / méiℏ-gām</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>British Pound Sterling</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">英鎊</div>
        <div class="col">yìng-bóng</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>European Euro</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">歐元/歐羅</div>
        <div class="col">aù-yùℏn / aù-lòℏ</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>$5</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">五蚊</div>
        <div class="col">ńgℏ-mān</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>$2</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">两蚊</div>
        <div class="col">léuℏng-mān</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>$5.30</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">五個三(銀錢)</div>
    <div>ńgℏ-go-sàam-(ngàℏn-chín)</div>
    <div><strong>$5.50</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">五個半(銀錢)</div>
    <div>ńgℏ-go-bun-(ngàℏn-chín)</div>
    <div><strong>50¢</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">五毫子</div>
        <div class="col">ńgℏ-hòuℏ-jí</div>
    </div>
</div>
